(4, 1, 'Raw Khadi Double-Weave Jhola', 'raw-khadi-double-weave-jhola', 'Unbleached natural cotton spun on Charkhas and hand-woven on wooden pitlooms. Breathable, durable, and completely plastic-free.', 'Perfect for Eco-conscious daily errands and markets.', 'BL-JHL-004', 949.00, 1399.00, 32.17, 45, '', 1, 0, 4.85, 70, 1),
