(7, 2, 'Urban Utility Crossbody Sling', 'urban-utility-crossbody-sling', 'Designed for quick transit. Features an easy-access front pocket, secure concealed rear compartment, and durable weather-treated woven cotton.', 'Perfect for City exploration, commutes, and essentials.', 'BL-SLG-002', 1399.00, 1999.00, 30.02, 45, 'HANDWOVEN', 1, 0, 4.76, 47, 1),
